AltoRewardsOracle::updateChainlinkNode()
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── when _chainlinkNode is valid
│       └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── given caller is owner
│   ├── when _chainlinkNode.feed is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidInput
│   ├── when _chainlinkNode.stalePeriod is zero
│   │   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidInput
│   ├── when _chainlinkNode.inDecimals is zero
│   │   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidInput
│   ├── when _chainlinkNode.outDecimals is zero
│   │   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidInput
│   ├── when _chainlinkNode.multiplied is not 0 or 1
│   │   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidInput
│   └── when _chainlinkNode is valid
│       ├── it should emit SetChainlinkNode event with old and new chainlink node
│       └── it should update chainlinkNode to new chainlink node